message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "R6A — Modular Vision-Guided Robotics"
abstract: >-
  Research platform for environment-adaptive robotics. A Gazebo digital twin
  generates annotated training data at scale; a keypoint model estimates the
  pose of a 6-DoF arm from plain RGB, with no fiducial marker on the robot, in
  an eye-to-hand layout; a physical multi-camera bench, characterised against
  ISO 9283, arbitrates the results.
